# Per-user pi session scaffold (agent settings + quiet-tools artifacts). The extension writes full
# read/bash/subagent output to .pi/quiet-tools/ before compacting it — that can hold credentials and
# must never be committed. Ignore the whole scaffold so a routine `git add -A` can't leak it.
.env
.pi/
